  "solution": {
    "text": "We know that, $\\sin 30^{\\circ}=\\frac{1}{2}=0.5$ In $1^{\\text {st }}$ quadrant $\\sin x$ is increasing function. $\\sin 31^{\\circ}>\\sin 30^{\\circ}$\r\n$\\Rightarrow \\quad \\sin 31^{\\circ}>0.5$"
